{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Convex Set","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸集（Convex Set）</h1>\n<p><strong>凸集</strong>(convex set)：<span class=\"math inline\">C</span> 中任意两点之间的线段都包含在 <span class=\"math inline\">C</span> 中。</p>\n<p>换成<a href=\"#/learn/opt.convex-combination?anchor=definition\">凸组合（convex combination）</a>的语言，即 <span class=\"math inline\">x,y\\in C</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">0\\le\\theta\\le1</span> 时，<span class=\"math inline\">\\theta x+(1-\\theta)y\\in C</span>。这个定义不要求包含由负系数组成的整条直线。</p>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">教材相应章节 / Reference</a>。</p>\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-boyd-convex-optimization\"><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">Convex Optimization</a> — Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe · 2004 · Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"opt.convex-set.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.convex-set","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"凸集"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Convex Set","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸集（Convex Set）</h1>\n<p><strong>凸集</strong>(convex set)：<span class=\"math inline\">C</span> 中任意两点之间的线段都包含在 <span class=\"math inline\">C</span> 中。</p>\n<p>换成<a href=\"#/learn/opt.convex-combination?anchor=definition